</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3">
<figure id="A2.F3.fig5" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.04331v1/figures/llama7B_HellaSwag.png" id="A2.F3.g5" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:612/459;" width="612" height="459" alt="Refer to caption">
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3">
<figure id="A2.F3.fig6" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.04331v1/figures/llama7B_WinoGrande.png" id="A2.F3.g6" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:612/459;" width="612" height="459" alt="Refer to caption">
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3">
<figure id="A2.F3.fig7" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.04331v1/figures/llama7B_ARC-e.png" id="A2.F3.g7" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:612/459;" width="612" height="459" alt="Refer to caption">
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3">
<figure id="A2.F3.fig8" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.04331v1/figures/llama7B_ARC-c.png" id="A2.F3.g8" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:612/459;" width="612" height="459" alt="Refer to caption">
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3">
<figure id="A2.F3.fig9" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.04331v1/figures/llama7B_OBQA.png" id="A2.F3.g9" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:612/459;" width="612" height="459" alt="Refer to caption">
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A2.F3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 3</span>: </span><span id="A2.F3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The detail of sample efficiency on each commonsense reasoning dataset with LLaMA-7B settings.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A2.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.3 </span>Detail of results on VTAB-1K datasets</h3>

<div id="A2.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A2.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In Table <a href="#A2.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ B.3 Detail of results on VTAB-1K datasets ‣ Appendix B Additional Experimental Details ‣ DoRAN: Stabilizing Weight-Decomposed Low-Rank Adaptation via Noise Injection and Auxiliary Networks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>, we provide the results of DoRAN in detail for each dataset in the VTAB-1K domain. Compared to DoRA, DoRAN delivers consistent improvements across all datasets and achieves state-of-the-art results on nearly all of them—except for CIFAR100 and sNORB-ele—while requiring only a modest increase in parameters. This highlights the benefit of sharing information across attention heads.</p>
</div>
