<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex165.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathrm{softmax}(\bm{X}^{\top}m_{Q,j}\frac{\bm{C}_{Q}+\sigma_{2}(\bm{B}_{j})\sigma_{1}(\bm{A}_{j})}{\|\bm{C}_{Q}+\sigma_{2}(\bm{B}_{j})\sigma_{1}(\bm{A}_{j})\|+\tau_{Q}}\bm{X}+c_{j})," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>softmax</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>𝑿</mi><mo>⊤</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>𝑪</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝑩</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝑨</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝑪</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><msub><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝑩</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>σ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>𝑨</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">‖</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>Q</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>𝑿</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathrm{softmax}(\bm{X}^{\top}m_{Q,j}\frac{\bm{C}_{Q}+\sigma_{2}(\bm{B}_{j})\sigma_{1}(\bm{A}_{j})}{\|\bm{C}_{Q}+\sigma_{2}(\bm{B}_{j})\sigma_{1}(\bm{A}_{j})\|+\tau_{Q}}\bm{X}+c_{j}),</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.SS2.SSS2.p3.4" class="ltx_p">for almost surely <math id="A3.SS2.SSS2.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\bm{X}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝑿</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\bm{X}}</annotation></semantics></math>. Given the invariance to translation of the softmax function, the equation (<a href="#A3.E20" title="In C.2.2 Global Part ‣ C.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix C Proofs ‣ DoRAN: Stabilizing Weight-Decomposed Low-Rank Adaptation via Noise Injection and Auxiliary Networks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">20</span></a>) leads to</p>
